{"ref":"BDB, מְנוּסָה","hw":"מְנוּסָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְנוּסָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. flight</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.12\">Is 52:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חִפָּזוֹן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנֻסַת־חֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.36\">Lv 26:36</a> = <em>flight from sword</em>, acc. cogn. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוס</span>.","next":"BDB, נוּעַ","prev":"BDB, מָנוֹס²"}